From 90633addcc7b0373c22c8c878905e8fc8bc5d2bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh <you@example.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:34:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Witness mode: headless deterministic test driver

Integrates the Witness toolkit (github.com/Josh17400/witness, patch made
on 8c0dcaf) behind EMBERVALE_WITNESS (desktop only; off for the web).
Fixes on top of the patch: deterministic journeys under syncStreams, exact
WITNESS_RECORD replays (id counter in the header, shared applyStart),
View/Audio rebuilt per reset, held inputs released on reset, canvas pinned
to 480x270, witness.json escape. witness/determinism.witness.json adds 9
tests (17 total).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WARTKEZHcFMxtkgMxMxVZ2
